parser.parseString(userInput, (err, result) => {
  // ...
});
```

#### Additional recommendations
- Follow the principle of least privilege and only grant the minimum required permissions to the XML parser.
- Implement input validation and sanitization for all user-controlled data before passing it to the XML parser.
- Consider using a secure XML parser library that disables external entity resolution by default.
